  "ALL_TEXT": "152 EXT. ROAD - DAY \nThe BUM is wandering along, when he sees a thrash-can shaped \nlike a woman. He walks up against it, slowly leans in to \nkiss, when it turns into a butterfly. He looks at it, tosses \nthe water he is carrying, and chases it down. He reaches the \nmiddle of the road, and catches the butterfly, admiring it. A \ngiant truck gets closer and closer to him, honking louder and \nlouder... The truck swerves to avoid him and crashes into a \nresting DCM nearby. Alcohol from the truck's cargo spills \nover. \nCUT TO: ",
